  "namedChanges": [
    "`PLAN_ONLY_TYPE_IDS` is imported from the merged unit `plan-kinds` (its body is the same as the source, lines 256-263; compared by script), `RECORD_TYPES` and `RecordTypeSpec` from `record-types`, and `vaultOriginOf` from `vault-origin-rule`",
    "`MIN_ONTOLOGY_QUERY` (a constant read from the environment at load, with `readMinOntologyQuery` and `DEFAULT_MIN_ONTOLOGY_QUERY`, none of them taken) becomes `minOntologyQuery()` from `base-origin`; `BLANK_QUERY_REACH`, built from it at load, becomes the function `blankQueryReach()`",
    "the environment read `import.meta.env.VITE_ONTOLOGY_API_ORIGIN ... ?.trim()` becomes `ontologyApiOrigin()`",
    "`isLocalDevHost` tests `localRigHosts().has(h)` in place of the three fixed loopback names",
    "`DEFAULT_ONTOLOGY_HOST` (`\"veda.gilb.com\"`, line 18 of `ontologyBrowse.ts`) becomes `defaultOntologyHost()`",
    "`TYPE_TERM_ORIGIN` (`typePicture.ts` line 18, not copied) becomes `termOrigin()` in `typeTermUrl`",
